[1mNAME[0m[m
       ls - list directory contents[m
[m
[1mSYNOPSIS[0m[m
       [1mls [22m[[4mOPTION[24m]... [[4mFILE[24m]...[m
[m
[1mDESCRIPTION[0m[m
       List  information  about  the FILEs (the current directory by default).[m
       Sort entries alphabetically if none of [1m-cftuvSUX [22mnor [1m--sort  [22mis  speci‐[m
       fied.[m
[m
       Mandatory  arguments  to  long  options are mandatory for short options[m
       too.[m
[m
       [1m-a[22m, [1m--all[0m[m
              do not ignore entries starting with .[m
[m
       [1m-A[22m, [1m--almost-all[0m[m
              do not list implied . and ..[m
[m
       [1m--author[0m[m
